{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":40,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝對祂子民的安慰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你們的上帝說：",{"text":"「你們要安慰安慰我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要勸慰耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向她宣告，她的苦難已經結束，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的罪惡已經被除去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她因自己的一切罪已受到耶和華加倍的懲罰","poem":1},{"noteId":19},{"text":"。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"有人高喊：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「在曠野預備耶和華的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在沙漠修直我們上帝的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一切山谷要被填滿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山小丘要被削平；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坎坷之地要變得平坦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"崎嶇之地要成為平原。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的榮耀必彰顯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人必一同看見。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親口說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"有聲音說：「呼喊吧！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我問道：「我呼喊什麼呢？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那聲音說：「芸芸眾生盡如草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"榮華紛縟像野地的花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華吹一口氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"草就枯乾，花也凋謝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人類誠然如草。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"草必枯乾，花必凋謝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我們上帝的話永遠長存。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"報好消息的錫安啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要登上高山！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報好消息的耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要大聲宣告！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要高聲說，不要害怕！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要對猶大的城邑說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們的上帝來了！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，主耶和華帶著能力來了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的臂膀執掌王權；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，祂帶著賞賜而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要酬勞祂的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像牧人一樣牧養自己的羊群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用臂膀把羊羔聚在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抱在懷中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"溫柔地引導母羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"誰曾用手心量海水？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰曾用手掌度蒼天？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰曾用升斗盛大地的塵土？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰曾用秤稱高山，用天平稱丘陵？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰曾測度耶和華的心？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰曾做祂的謀士指點祂？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂受過誰的點悟？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰教過祂公正之道？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰教過祂知識？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰傳授過祂悟性之道？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，列國就像水桶中的一滴水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如天平上的塵埃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，祂舉起眾海島，好像捧起微塵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的樹木不夠作獻祭的柴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它林中的走獸也不夠作燔祭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國在祂面前都不算什麼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在祂看來還不如虛無。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"你們拿誰與上帝相比呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們用什麼形像比作上帝呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像是工匠製造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金匠替它鑲金、打造銀鏈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"買不起這種偶像的人就選一塊耐用的木頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找個能工巧匠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雕出一個可以站立不倒的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"難道你們不知道嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你們沒有聽過嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不是從起初就告訴過你們嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道從大地奠立根基以來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們一直沒有明白嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝坐在大地的圓圈之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的人類好像蚱蜢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂鋪展諸天，就像鋪展幔子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"展開諸天，如展開居住的帳篷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使掌權者歸於無有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使世上的審判官化為虛無。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們剛被栽上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剛被種上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剛在土裡扎根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝一吹，他們便枯乾了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴風將他們像碎稭一樣吹去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"聖者說：「你們拿誰與我相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之與我同等呢？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們向天舉目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看是誰創造了這萬象？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是誰把眾星一一領出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按各自的名字叫它們？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的權柄和能力偉大無比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們一個也不會少。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，你怎能說耶和華看不見你的遭遇呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你怎能說上帝無視你的冤情呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你不知道？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你沒有聽見過？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是永恆的上帝，是創造地極的主宰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不會疲乏，也不會困倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的智慧深不可測。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂賜疲乏的人能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給軟弱的人加力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使青年也會疲乏困倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強壯的人也會踉蹌跌倒；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但仰望耶和華的人必重新得力。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必像鷹一樣展翅高飛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們奔跑也不困倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們行走也不疲乏。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":19,"caller":"+","text":"「她因自己的一切罪已受到耶和華加倍的懲罰」或譯「她的一切罪已得到耶和華雙倍的赦免」。","reference":{"chapter":40,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/40.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/41.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/39.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}